{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "112", "x": 0.9003897281068982, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.0333535204967375, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "1.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.020609553398225476, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Well, that's a difficult question. I mean, both are important in different ways.", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.7658837809931653, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "But if I had to choose, I'd probably say having good colleagues can gain you more", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.826730495627157, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "job satisfaction. I mean, when you work with people who are friendly, supportive,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.17970752416545568, "w": 0.8259029142000445, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "and easy to get along with, it really helps you enjoy your day, even if the job itself", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2080378742395933, "w": 0.8262294561779128, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "is stressful. Of course, a high salary is important too. It gives you a sense of", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.23636822431373095, "w": 0.8267400304478608, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "security and allows you to enjoy life outside of work, but let's be honest, if you're", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.26469857438786853, "w": 0.8258160755641718, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "surrounded by toxic workmates, even a well-paid job can feel like a nightmare. So", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2930660423122369, "w": 0.8266544221114338, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "yeah, I'd say a good team often matters more than money, at least in the long run.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.32139637352567824, "w": 0.8268583442445515, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "2.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.39778456980788796, "w": 0.025044142118860666, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Well, I think it really depends on the person and the type of job they have. I", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.39778456980788796, "w": 0.7654482549894025, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "mean, some people feel more satisfied when they face new challenges and get to", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4261149576034181, "w": 0.8260555738562598, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "learn different skills, so changing jobs from time to time helps them stay", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4544453076775557, "w": 0.825968325120572, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "motivated and avoid getting bored. But others might prefer stability and a clear", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.48280040298518045, "w": 0.8261977759671871, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "career path, and they feel more fulfilled when they can grow deeper in one role", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5111307907807106, "w": 0.8260121032758466, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "over time. What I want to say is, not everyone wants to start over again and again.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5394611408548482, "w": 0.8263598679191525, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "So, I'd say people don't necessarily need to change jobs on a regular basis to feel", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5677915286503784, "w": 0.826367454765734, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "satisfied, but for some, it can be a good way to keep things fresh and exciting.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5961219164459085, "w": 0.7941700056480997, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "3.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6725471551355638, "w": 0.025648859927639937, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Well, I guess it is possible, but not everyone will find it easy. I mean, job", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.6725471551355638, "w": 0.7656008121206641, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "satisfaction is a really personal thing. Some people can feel satisfied even in very", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7008775052097015, "w": 0.8263135266400328, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "basic or repetitive jobs, as long as they feel they're doing something rewarding or", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7292079307266242, "w": 0.826466801445971, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "working with people they like. Take a cleaner or a delivery person for example,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7575382808007618, "w": 0.8261207797268797, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "their jobs might not seem that exciting or glamorous, but if the work environment", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7858686308748994, "w": 0.8264518328027154, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "is supportive and they feel respected, it can also make a huge difference. So yeah,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8141990563918221, "w": 0.8263382351538997, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "I think people can find satisfaction in most kinds of work with the right mindset", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8425294064659596, "w": 0.8259247520152049, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "and environment. But of course, it's not always that simple.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8708845017735845, "w": 0.6022732294119897, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}